    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This stunning two-bedroom penthouse apartment enjoys a truly enviable position within the highly regarded Eden Wood development and boasts magnificent sea and mountain views that are undoubtedly one of the property's most striking features. The apartment is a wonderful blend of space, light and comfort, with its impressive elevated position and extensive glazing creating a bright and uplifting atmosphere throughout. It is easy to imagine relaxing here with a glass of champagne while taking in the sheer splendour of the surrounding coastal and mountain scenery.\n\nA particularly impressive feature of this exceptional apartment is the entire L-shaped exterior wall, which is predominantly glass, allowing an abundance of natural light to flood into the living accommodation while ensuring the spectacular views can be enjoyed to their fullest. The sense of space created by the extensive glazing is remarkable and gives the principal living areas a wonderful open and airy feel.\n\nEden Wood was built by the renowned Cosgrave Homes and is an exclusive and well-established development ideally located within easy reach of Greystones town, Delgany and Kilcoole, with the N11 just approximately two minutes away by car. \n\nThe communal gardens are a particular feature of Eden Wood. They are beautifully landscaped and exceptionally well maintained, with an abundance of mature shrubs, specimen trees, plants and well-tended lawns creating a wonderfully attractive and peaceful environment. The development also benefits from a lift serving the apartment block, coded entrance gates and an intercom system, providing both convenience and security.\n\nThe accommodation is generously proportioned and briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and exceptionally spacious open-plan living and dining room, a modern and well-equipped kitchen, two generous double bedrooms, principal bedroom with ensuite and a main bathroom.\n\nSpecial Features\nStunning sea and mountain views from the apartment's exceptional elevated position.\nL-shaped floor-to-ceiling glass exterior wall, maximising natural light, space and the spectacular views.\nBright and spacious open-plan living and dining area.\nModern, fully fitted and well-equipped kitchen \nTwo spacious double bedrooms, including an ensuite to the principal bedroom.\nModern, fully tiled main bathroom and ensuite.\nDouble glazing throughout.\nFitted wardrobes.\nLift serving the apartment block.\nSecure development with coded entrance gates and intercom system.\nImmaculately maintained communal gardens with mature trees, shrubs and planting.\nAmple communal parking.\nExcellent location close to Greystones, Delgany and Kilcoole.\nApproximately 2 minutes' drive from the N11 and within easy reach of Greystones DART station.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance hallway:\nProvides a pleasant introduction to the apartment and features tiled flooring, an intercom phone system, storage cupboard and hotpress, providing useful additional storage.\n\nLiving/dining room: \nIs undoubtedly the heart of this wonderful home. It is a particularly bright and spacious room, with the extensive L-shaped glazing providing an exceptional sense of openness and allowing the beautiful sea and mountain views to become a natural part of the living space. The generous proportions provide ample room for both comfortable seating and dining areas, making this an ideal space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nKitchen:\nA modern and practical, with an excellent range of fitted high-gloss wall and floor units complemented by attractive granite countertops and splashback. There is also a useful breakfast counter, making the space ideal for informal dining. Integrated appliances include a fridge freezer, dishwasher, built-in oven, hob, stainless-steel extractor fan and double stainless-steel sink and drainer. There is also provision for a washing machine.\n\nMaster bedrooms:\nDouble bedroom with floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes \n\nEnsuite: \nFully Tiles with shower, WC and wash hand basin. Large fitted mirror and heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2:\nA second spacious bedroom with fitted wardrobes and floor to ceiling windows.\n\nMain bathroom:\nFully tiled and finished to a high standard, incorporating a bath with glass shower screen and shower connection, WC and wash hand basin. A large fitted mirror with recessed lighting adds a contemporary finishing touch.\n\nBalcony: \nPrivate outdoor balcony enjoying stunning sea and mountain views, with a lovely outlook over the beautifully maintained communal grounds and mature landscaped gardens. Communal surface parking is also available."
      },
